  2	 * Unit tests for Task Board (Kanban) column distribution logic.
  3	 *
  4	 * AC: @ui-task-board ac-1 — Tasks distributed into correct columns
  5	 * AC: @ui-task-board ac-2 — Utility functions for card metadata
