  7	 *
  8	 * Colors (16): oklch color space for perceptual uniformity
  9	 * Radii (4): border-radius scale
 10	 * Spacing (7): spacing scale
 11	 * Z-Index (7): layer stack
 12	 * Fonts (3): typography families
 13	 * Status (7): task status semantic colors
 14	 */
 15	
 16	:root {
 17	  /* ── Colors (16 core tokens) ── */
